{"slug": "what-we-do-put-plans-into-action", "title": "Put plans into action — What we do — SetuHashi", "description": "Connect commercial intentions with practical delivery.", "mainClass": "main-do", "scripts": [], "langHref": "/ja/what-we-do-put-plans-into-action/", "html": "<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"You are here\"><ol><li><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-do/\">What we do</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Put plans into action</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"layout\"><aside class=\"local\" aria-label=\"What we do\">\n<p class=\"local-k\"><a href=\"/en/what-we-do/\">What we do</a></p>\n<p class=\"local-lead\">Our work spans four connected activities. An assignment may involve one or several, depending on what you need.</p>\n<details class=\"local-d\" open><summary><span>In this section: Put plans into action</span><span class=\"ln-count\">3 of 4</span></summary>\n<nav aria-label=\"In this section\"><ul class=\"ln\"><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-do/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Find opportunities</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-do-develop-business/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Develop business</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-do-put-plans-into-action/\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Put plans into action</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-do-strengthen-and-renew/\"><span class=\"ln-l\">Strengthen and renew</span></a></li></ul></nav></details>\n</aside><article class=\"view\" aria-labelledby=\"vh\">\n<h1 id=\"vh\" class=\"v-h\">Put plans into action</h1><p class=\"v-tag\">Connect commercial intentions with practical delivery.</p>\n<div class=\"v-grid\"><div class=\"v-body\"><p>We help bring together the organizations, capabilities and working arrangements an assignment needs. Depending on the agreed role, we can coordinate participants, support implementation and remain involved as the work develops.</p><div class=\"v-q\"><p class=\"lab\">The practical question</p><p class=\"v-q-t\">What needs to come together to make this work?</p></div></div><div class=\"v-fig\"><figure class=\"fig fig-act fig-nav\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 260\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Connected activities\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"lk\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"60\"/><line x1=\"305\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"200\"/><line x1=\"305\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"200\"/><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"60\"/><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"200\"/><line x1=\"305\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"200\"/></g><a class=\"nd\" href=\"/en/what-we-do/\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"7\" y=\"34\" width=\"176\" height=\"52\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Find opportunities</text></a><a class=\"nd\" href=\"/en/what-we-do-develop-business/\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"217\" y=\"34\" width=\"176\" height=\"52\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Develop business</text></a><a class=\"nd on\" href=\"/en/what-we-do-put-plans-into-action/\" aria-current=\"page\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"217\" y=\"174\" width=\"176\" height=\"52\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Put plans into action</text></a><a class=\"nd\" href=\"/en/what-we-do-strengthen-and-renew/\"><rect class=\"hit\" x=\"7\" y=\"174\" width=\"176\" height=\"52\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Strengthen and renew</text></a></svg><figcaption>Connected activities, not stages: an assignment can begin with any of them. <span class=\"fig-hint\">Select a box to open that view.</span></figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div class=\"onward\"><h2 class=\"lab\">Services that put this into practice</h2><ul class=\"go\"><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-4/#s-4-1\">Establish cross-border operations</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-4/#s-4-3\">Prepare teams to work together</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/what-we-offer-objective-6/#s-6-1\">Bring organizations together to deliver</a></li></u